ATHENA Private Guile Runtime
============================

This is ATHENA's embedded, Scheme-only fork of GNU Guile 3.0.10, not a
general-purpose Guile distribution. See ATHENA-UPSTREAM.md for provenance,
retained facilities, removed features, and build instructions.

Build and install through ATHENA's CMake integration. The private guile
executable runs batch scripts; it has no interactive or network REPL.
The Scheme compiler and noninteractive backtraces remain part of the runtime.

Report integration problems to the ATHENA project, not upstream GNU Guile.

See LICENSE, COPYING, and COPYING.LESSER for licensing terms. Upstream
copyright and attribution notices remain applicable. A copyright year range
YYYY-ZZZZ designates every year in that interval.
